  "scope": "Six independent required waffle-drop predicates per metal m1-m4, with exact integer-area comparisons on explicitly supplied 700 by 700 um windows. Drawing and native fill are unioned before intersection; holes, overlapping shapes and hierarchy are preserved. These are numerical observations of drawn-plus-fill metal, not an oxide metric or acceptance of a generated final mask. No window origin, step, boundary clipping or small-cell exclusion is inferred. Nonempty drop operands remain unreviewed even when every sampled window passes, or no full window is supplied. Only an empty raw drop layer proves the corresponding 12 catalog antecedents absent everywhere. No previously absent catalog records become newly executed from these observations.",
